    "link": "https://milanosirki.com/",
    "content": "<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull milano-hero-v2 has-text-color has-background\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;background:linear-gradient(130deg,#061129 0%,#101B49 52%,#65182E 100%);background-color:#091746;padding-top:74px;padding-right:22px;padding-bottom:84px;padding-left:22px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:55%\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.12em\">✦ 2026–2027 TÜRKİYE TURNESİ ✦</p>\n\n\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:clamp(40px,6vw,76px);font-weight:900;line-height:1.05\">ULUSLARARASI<br>MILANO SİRKİ</h1>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:23px;font-weight:700\">Büyüleyici bir sahne macerasına hazır mısınız?</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:18px;line-height:1.7\">Akrobasi, denge, jonglörlük ve kahkaha dolu performanslarla bütün aile için unutulmaz gösteri deneyimi.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"#gosteri-takvimi\" style=\"border-radius:40px;color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#C72528;padding-top:16px;padding-right:26px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:26px\">Gösteri Takvimi</a></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/milanosirkiturkiye/\" style=\"border-radius:40px;color:#091746;background-color:#F5C04A;padding-top:16px;padding-right:26px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:26px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Instagram'da Takip Et</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800\">✦ Hayvansız Gösteri &nbsp; · &nbsp; 50–60 Dakika &nbsp; · &nbsp; Ailece Eğlence</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:45%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-radius:28px;background-color:#FFFFFF;padding-top:22px;padding-right:22px;padding-bottom:22px;padding-left:22px;box-shadow:0 25px 75px rgba(0,0,0,.30);border:3px solid #F5C04A\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-full\"><img src=\"https://milanosirki.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/milano-sirki-resmi-logo.webp\" alt=\"Uluslararası Milano Sirki resmi logosu\" class=\"wp-image-7\"/></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull milano-stage-illustration-v1 has-text-color has-background\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#091746;padding-top:34px;padding-right:22px;padding-bottom:40px;padding-left:22px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.12em\">✦ MİLANO SAHNE ATMOSFERİ ✦</p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\" style=\"border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 15px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.22)\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/milanosirki.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Milano-Sirki-%E2%80%94-Temsili-Isikli-Sirk-Sahnesi.png?fit=1024%2C585&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"Lacivert ve bordo renkli, altın spot ışıklarıyla aydınlatılmış temsili sirk sahnesi illüstrasyonu\" class=\"wp-image-72\" srcset=\"https://i0.wp.com/milanosirki.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Milano-Sirki-%E2%80%94-Temsili-Isikli-Sirk-Sahnesi.png?fit=300%2C171&amp;ssl=1 300w, https://i0.wp.com/milanosirki.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Milano-Sirki-%E2%80%94-Temsili-Isikli-Sirk-Sahnesi.png?fit=768%2C439&amp;ssl=1 768w, https://i0.wp.com/milanosirki.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Milano-Sirki-%E2%80%94-Temsili-Isikli-Sirk-Sahnesi.png?fit=1024%2C585&amp;ssl=1 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1100px) calc(100vw - 44px), 1024px\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"585\" style=\"border-radius:24px;display:block;width:100%;height:auto\"/></figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:13px\">Tanıtım amaçlı temsili illüstrasyon · Gerçek gösteri fotoğrafı değildir.</p>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<section class=\"wp-block-group alignwide\" id=\"milano-show-highlights\" style=\"padding:48px 24px\"><p style=\"text-align:center;color:#C72528;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em\">SAHNEDE HEYECAN, KALPLERDE MUTLULUK</p><h2 style=\"text-align:center;color:#091746;font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);line-height:1.2\">Perde açıldığında macera başlar</h2><p style=\"max-width:780px;margin:20px auto 30px;text-align:center;color:#39435A\">Renkli, hayvansız sahne gösterimizde ustalık, ritim ve eğlence bir araya geliyor. Milano Sirki’nin dünyasını keşfedin; ailenizle paylaşacağınız gösteri için turne takvimini inceleyin.</p><div class=\"wp-block-columns\" style=\"align-items:stretch\"><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><article style=\"height:100%;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6DFC9;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(9,23,70,.08)\"><figure style=\"margin:0\"><img src=\"https://milanosirki.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/milano-akrobasi-sahne-illustrasyonu-20261015-768x512.png\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\" alt=\"Lacivert ve kırmızı sahnede akrobasi ekibinin denge gösterisini canlandıran temsili illüstrasyon\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\"></figure><div style=\"padding:24px\"><h3 style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;color:#091746\">Akrobasi ve Denge</h3><p style=\"color:#39435A;line-height:1.75\">Güç, çeviklik ve ekip uyumu sahnede buluşuyor. Birlikte kurulan dengeler ve ustalık isteyen hareketler, çocukların merakını ve yetişkinlerin hayranlığını aynı anda yakalıyor.</p><a href=\"/gosterilerimiz/#akrobasi\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;color:#C72528;font-weight:800;text-decoration:underline\">Gösteriyi keşfet →</a></div></article></div><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><article style=\"height:100%;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6DFC9;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(9,23,70,.08)\"><figure style=\"margin:0\"><img src=\"https://milanosirki.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/milano-ritim-sahne-illustrasyonu-20261015-768x512.png\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\" alt=\"Renkli halkalar ve jonglörlük performansını canlandıran temsili sirk illüstrasyonu\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\"></figure><div style=\"padding:24px\"><h3 style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;color:#091746\">Ritim ve Hareket</h3><p style=\"color:#39435A;line-height:1.75\">Jonglörlük, hula hoop ve hareket performanslarıyla gösterinin temposu yükseliyor. Renkler, dönüşler ve koordinasyon isteyen geçişler, izleyiciyi sahnenin ritmine davet ediyor.</p><a href=\"/gosterilerimiz/#ritim\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;color:#C72528;font-weight:800;text-decoration:underline\">Gösteriyi keşfet →</a></div></article></div><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><article style=\"height:100%;background:#FFFFFF;border:1px solid #E6DFC9;border-radius:22px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(9,23,70,.08)\"><figure style=\"margin:0\"><img src=\"https://milanosirki.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/milano-eglence-sahne-illustrasyonu-20261015-768x512.png\" width=\"768\" height=\"512\" alt=\"Kırmızı ve lacivert kostümlü iki neşeli palyaçoyu canlandıran temsili illüstrasyon\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto\"></figure><div style=\"padding:24px\"><h3 style=\"font-size:24px;line-height:1.25;color:#091746\">Ailece Eğlence</h3><p style=\"color:#39435A;line-height:1.75\">Palyaçolar, komik sürprizler ve renkli karakterlerle kahkaha sahneye taşınıyor. Çocuklar ve yetişkinler, birlikte gülümseyecekleri keyifli bir gösteri deneyimini paylaşıyor.</p><a href=\"/gosterilerimiz/#eglence\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;color:#C72528;font-weight:800;text-decoration:underline\">Gösteriyi keşfet →</a></div></article></div></div><p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#596174;text-align:center\">Tanıtım amaçlı temsili sahne illüstrasyonları.</p></section>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull milano-ui-cards-v1 has-background\" style=\"background-color:#F7F5F0;padding-top:76px;padding-right:22px;padding-bottom:80px;padding-left:22px\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#B51628;font-size:13px;font-weight:800\">✦ &nbsp; MİLANO SİRKİ DÜNYASI</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"color:#091746;font-size:38px;font-weight:800\">Sahnenin büyüsü, her ekranda</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#39435A;font-size:17px;font-weight:400\">Gösterilerimizi keşfedin, turnemizi takip edin ve bize kolayca ulaşın. Tüm bilgiler tek bir yerde.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:26px;color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#091746;padding-top:34px;padding-right:30px;padding-bottom:34px;padding-left:30px;box-shadow:0 14px 44px rgba(9,23,70,.13)\">\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800\">✦ &nbsp; 01 / SAHNE</p>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:27px;font-weight:800\">Gösterilerimiz</h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-weight:400\">Akrobasi, denge, jonglörlük ve palyaço performansları.</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:15px;font-weight:800\"><a href=\"/gosterilerimiz/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:999px;box-sizing:border-box\">Keşfet →</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:26px;color:#091746;background-color:#FFFFFF;padding-top:34px;padding-right:30px;padding-bottom:34px;padding-left:30px;box-shadow:0 14px 44px rgba(9,23,70,.13)\">\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#B51628;font-size:14px;font-weight:800\">◉ &nbsp; 02 / TURNE</p>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#091746;font-size:27px;font-weight:800\">Şehirler ve gösteriler</h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#091746;font-size:16px;font-weight:400\">Türkiye turnesi duyurularını ve program bilgilerini takip edin.</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"color:#B51628;font-size:15px;font-weight:800\"><a href=\"/sehirler/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:999px;box-sizing:border-box\">Keşfet →</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:26px;color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#BD1D2D;padding-top:34px;padding-right:30px;padding-bottom:34px;padding-left:30px;box-shadow:0 14px 44px rgba(9,23,70,.13)\">\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#FFE6A5;font-size:14px;font-weight:800\">★ &nbsp; 03 / ÖZEL ETKİNLİK</p>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:27px;font-weight:800\">Kurumsal organizasyonlar</h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:16px;font-weight:400\">Okul, belediye, festival ve şirket etkinlikleri için iş birliği.</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"color:#FFE6A5;font-size:15px;font-weight:800\"><a href=\"/kurumsal-organizasyonlar/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:999px;box-sizing:border-box\">Keşfet →</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:26px;color:#091746;background-color:#FFE8AF;padding-top:34px;padding-right:30px;padding-bottom:34px;padding-left:30px;box-shadow:0 14px 44px rgba(9,23,70,.13)\">\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#8B1721;font-size:14px;font-weight:800\">◇ &nbsp; 04 / REHBER</p>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#091746;font-size:27px;font-weight:800\">Bilet ve sık sorulanlar</h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-left\" style=\"color:#091746;font-size:16px;font-weight:400\">Gösteri süresi, yaş grupları ve giriş bilgilerini öğrenin.</p>\n\n\n<p style=\"color:#8B1721;font-size:15px;font-weight:800\"><a href=\"/sikca-sorulan-sorular/\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:999px;box-sizing:border-box\">Keşfet →</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:22px;color:#091746;background-color:#FFFFFF;padding-top:25px;padding-right:30px;padding-bottom:25px;padding-left:30px;box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(9,23,70,.08)\">\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"color:#091746;font-size:20px;font-weight:800\">✉ &nbsp; Sorunuz mu var?</p>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"color:#39435A;font-size:16px;font-weight:400\">Milano Sirki ekibine doğrudan <a href=\"https://wa.me/905363583381\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid #B51628;border-radius:999px;box-sizing:border-box;color:#091746;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px\">WhatsApp: 0536 358 33 81</a> üzerinden ulaşabilirsiniz.</p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull milano-instagram-feature-v1 has-text-color has-background\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;background:linear-gradient(125deg,#091746 0%,#192052 50%,#65182E 100%);background-color:#091746;padding-top:70px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:74px;padding-left:24px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns are-vertically-aligned-center\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:58%\">\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#F5C04A;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.12em\">✦ BİZİ INSTAGRAM’DA TAKİP EDİN ✦</p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,48px);font-weight:800;line-height:1.2\">Milano Sirki’nin renkli dünyası Instagram’da!</h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;font-size:17px;line-height:1.7\">Turne duyuruları, sahneden özel anlar ve gösterilerimizle ilgili yenilikler için resmî Instagram hesabımızı keşfedin.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/milanosirkiturkiye/\" style=\"border-radius:40px;color:#091746;background-color:#F5C04A;padding-top:16px;padding-right:26px;padding-bottom:16px;padding-left:26px\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Instagram'da bizi takip edin ↗</a></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:42%\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-text-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:26px;color:#091746;background-color:#FFF8ED;padding-top:30px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:30px;padding-left:24px;box-shadow:0 18px 45px rgba(0,0,0,.22);border:2px solid #F5C04A\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-thumbnail is-resized\"><img src=\"https://milanosirki.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/milano-sirki-resmi-logo.webp\" alt=\"Milano Sirki resmî logosu\" class=\"wp-image-7\" style=\"width:110px\"/></figure>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"color:#091746;font-size:25px;font-weight:800\">@milanosirkiturkiye</h3>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"color:#B51628;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.08em\">RESMÎ INSTAGRAM HESABIMIZ</p>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"color:#39435A;font-size:15px\">Yeni şehirler, gösteriler ve Milano Sirki'nden paylaşımlar.</p>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"color:#B51628;font-size:16px;font-weight:800\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/milanosirkiturkiye/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:44px;padding:8px 16px;border:1px solid currentColor;border-radius:999px;box-sizing:border-box\">Profili ziyaret et →</a></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:jetpack/instagram-gallery {\"accessToken\":\"32263575\",\"instagramUser\":\"milanosirkiturkiye\",\"count\":6,\"spacing\":12} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-jetpack-instagram-gallery\"><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/milanosirkiturkiye/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.instagram.com/milanosirkiturkiye/</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:jetpack/instagram-gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"background\":\"#C72528\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"60px\",\"right\":\"24px\",\"bottom\":\"60px\",\"left\":\"24px\"}}},\"anchor\":\"gosteri-takvimi\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-text-color has-background\" id=\"gosteri-takvimi\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF;background-color:#C72528;padding-top:60px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:60px;padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"13px\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"letterSpacing\":\"0.1em\",\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.1em\">TÜRKİYE TURNESİ</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"className\":\"has-text-align-center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#FFFFFF\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#FFFFFF\">Şehrinizdeki gösteriyi keşfedin</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\">22 Ekim gösterimiz: <strong>Yalova · 22 Ekim 2026 Perşembe</strong>. <strong>90. Yıl Kapalı Spor Salonu</strong> (Bahçelievler Mahallesi, Turhan Koçal Caddesi No:13).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"20px\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"font-size:20px;font-weight:800\">Seanslar: 18.00 ve 19.30 · Serbest oturma · Seans başına 500 kişi</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>Yetişkin: 490 TL</strong> · <strong>Çocuk (3–12 yaş): 245 TL</strong> · <strong>Aile paketi (2 yetişkin + 2 çocuk): 1.100 TL</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"textAlign\":\"center\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><a href=\"/sehirler/\"><strong>Yalova gösterisinin tüm detaylarını görüntüle →</strong></a> · <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/RnN2pZFTMoMD2W23